\q2 \rb Woe|א֥וֹי\rb* \rb to us,|לָ֖נוּ\rb* \rb for|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb we are ruined!|שֻׁדָּֽדְנוּ׃\rb*
\q1 \v 14 \rb Wash|כַּבְּסִ֨י\rb* \rb the evil|מֵרָעָ֤ה\rb* \rb from your heart,|לִבֵּךְ֙\rb* \rb O Jerusalem,|יְר֣וּשָׁלִַ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb so that|לְמַ֖עַן\rb* \rb you may be saved.|תִּוָּשֵׁ֑עִי\rb*
\q1 \rb How long|עַד־\rb*\rb |מָתַ֛י\rb* \rb will you harbor|תָּלִ֥ין\rb*
