\q1 \v 15 \rb For|כִּ֛י\rb* \rb a voice|ק֥וֹל\rb* \rb resounds|מַגִּ֖יד\rb* \rb from Dan,|מִדָּ֑ן\rb*
\q2 \rb proclaiming|וּמַשְׁמִ֥יעַ\rb* \rb disaster|אָ֖וֶן\rb* \rb from the hills|מֵהַ֥ר\rb* \rb of Ephraim.|אֶפְרָֽיִם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 16 \rb Warn|הַזְכִּ֣ירוּ\rb* \rb the nations|לַגּוֹיִ֗ם\rb* \rb now!|הִנֵּה֙\rb*
\q2 \rb Proclaim|הַשְׁמִ֣יעוּ\rb* \rb to|עַל־\rb* \rb Jerusalem:|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֔ם\rb*
\q1 \rb “A besieging army|נֹצְרִ֥ים\rb* \rb comes|בָּאִ֖ים\rb* \rb from a distant|הַמֶּרְחָ֑ק\rb* \rb land;|מֵאֶ֣רֶץ\rb*
\q2 \rb they raise|וַֽיִּתְּנ֛וּ\rb* \rb their voices|קוֹלָֽם׃\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb the cities|עָרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of Judah.|יְהוּדָ֖ה\rb*
\q1 \v 17 \rb They surround her|מִסָּבִ֑יב\rb* \rb like men guarding|כְּשֹׁמְרֵ֣י\rb* \rb a field,|שָׂדַ֔י\rb*\rb |הָי֥וּ\rb*\rb |עָלֶ֖יהָ\rb*
\q2 \rb because|כִּי־\rb*\rb |אֹתִ֥י\rb* \rb she has rebelled against Me,”|מָרָ֖תָה\rb* \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 18 \rb “Your ways|דַּרְכֵּךְ֙\rb* \rb and deeds|וּמַ֣עֲלָלַ֔יִךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb have brought|עָשׂ֥וֹ\rb* \rb this|אֵ֖לֶּה\rb* \rb upon you.|לָ֑ךְ\rb*
