\q2 \rb because|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb it pierces|נָגַ֖ע\rb* \rb to the|עַד־\rb* \rb heart!”|לִבֵּֽךְ׃ס\rb*
\s1 Lamentation for Judah
\q1 \v 19 \rb My anguish,|מֵעַ֣י׀\rb* \rb my anguish!|מֵעַ֨י׀\rb* \rb I writhe in pain!|אָחוּלָה\rb*
