\q2 \rb but they know|יָדָֽעוּ׃\rb* \rb not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb how to do good.”|וּלְהֵיטִ֖יב\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 23 \rb I looked|רָאִ֙יתִי֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb at the earth,|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb*\rb |וְהִנֵּה־\rb*
