\q1 \v 25 \rb I looked,|רָאִ֕יתִי\rb*\rb |וְהִנֵּ֖ה\rb* \rb and no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb man was left;|הָאָדָ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb all|וְכָל־\rb* \rb the birds|ע֥וֹף\rb* \rb of the air|הַשָּׁמַ֖יִם\rb* \rb had fled.|נָדָֽדוּ׃\rb*
