\c 5
\s1 No One Is Just
\q1 \v 1 \rb “Go up and down|שׁוֹטְט֞וּ\rb* \rb the streets|בְּחוּצ֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Jerusalem.|יְרוּשָׁלִַ֗ם\rb*
