\q1 \rb If|אִם־\rb* \rb you can find|תִּמְצְא֣וּ\rb* \rb a single person,|אִ֔ישׁ\rb*\rb |אִם־\rb*\rb |יֵ֛שׁ\rb*
\q2 \rb anyone who acts|עֹשֶׂ֥ה\rb* \rb justly,|מִשְׁפָּ֖ט\rb*
