\b 
\q1 \v 3 \rb O LORD,|יְהֹוָ֗ה\rb* \rb do not|הֲל֣וֹא\rb* \rb Your eyes look|עֵינֶיךָ֮\rb* \rb for truth?|לֶאֱמוּנָה֒\rb*
\q2 \rb You struck them,|הִכִּ֤יתָה\rb*\rb |אֹתָם֙\rb* \rb but they felt no|וְֽלֹא־\rb* \rb pain.|חָ֔לוּ\rb*
