\q2 \rb and refused|מֵאֲנ֖וּ\rb* \rb to repent.|לָשֽׁוּב׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \rb Then I|וַאֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb said,|אָמַ֔רְתִּי\rb* \rb “They|הֵ֑ם\rb* \rb are only|אַךְ־\rb* \rb the poor;|דַּלִּ֖ים\rb*
\q2 \rb they have played the fool,|נוֹאֲל֕וּ\rb*
