\q2 \rb the justice|מִשְׁפַּ֖ט\rb* \rb of their God.|אֱלֹהֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*
\q1 \v 5 \rb I will go|אֵֽלֲכָה־\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb the powerful|הַגְּדֹלִים֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and speak|וַאֲדַבְּרָ֣ה\rb* \rb to them.|אוֹתָ֔ם\rb*
\q1 \rb Surely|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb they|הֵ֗מָּה\rb* \rb know|יָדְעוּ֙\rb* \rb the way|דֶּ֣רֶךְ\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
