\p \v 11 \rb Thus|כִּדְנָה֙\rb* \rb you are to tell|תֵּאמְר֣וּן\rb* \rb them:|לְה֔וֹם\rb* \rb “These gods,|אֱלָ֣הַיָּ֔א\rb* \rb who|דִּֽי־\rb* \rb have made|עֲבַ֑דוּ\rb* \rb neither|לָ֣א\rb* \rb the heavens|שְׁמַיָּ֥א\rb* \rb nor the earth,|וְאַרְקָ֖א\rb* \rb will perish|יֵאבַ֧דוּ\rb* \rb from this earth|מֵֽאַרְעָ֛א\rb* \rb and from|וּמִן־\rb* \rb under|תְּח֥וֹת\rb* \rb these|אֵֽלֶּה׃ס\rb* \rb heavens.”|שְׁמַיָּ֖א\rb*\f + \fr 10:11 \ft The original text of this verse is in Aramaic.\f*
