\q1 \rb It will make|לָשׂ֞וּם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the cities|עָרֵ֧י\rb* \rb of Judah|יְהוּדָ֛ה\rb* \rb a desolation,|שְׁמָמָ֖ה\rb*
