\q1 \v 23 \rb I know,|יָדַ֣עְתִּי\rb* \rb O LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb that|כִּ֛י\rb* \rb a man’s|לָאָדָ֖ם\rb* \rb way|דַּרְכּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb is not his own;|לֹ֥א\rb*
