\q2 \rb They have grown|יֵלְכ֖וּ\rb* \rb and|גַּם־\rb* \rb produced|עָ֣שׂוּ\rb* \rb fruit.|פֶ֑רִי\rb*\rb |קָר֤וֹב\rb*
\q1 \rb You|אַתָּה֙\rb* \rb are ever on their lips,|בְּפִיהֶ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb but far|וְרָח֖וֹק\rb* \rb from their hearts.|מִכִּלְיוֹתֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*\f + \fr 12:2 \ft Hebrew \fqa their kidneys\f*
\q1 \v 3 \rb But You|וְאַתָּ֤ה\rb* \rb know me,|יְדַעְתָּ֔נִי\rb* \rb O LORD;|יְהוָה֙\rb*
\q2 \rb You see me|תִּרְאֵ֕נִי\rb* \rb and test|וּבָחַנְתָּ֥\rb* \rb my heart|לִבִּ֖י\rb* \rb toward You.|אִתָּ֑ךְ\rb*
\q1 \rb Drag away the wicked|הַתִּקֵם֙\rb* \rb like sheep|כְּצֹ֣אן\rb* \rb to the slaughter|לְטִבְחָ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and set them apart|וְהַקְדִּשֵׁ֖ם\rb* \rb for the day|לְי֥וֹם\rb* \rb of carnage.|הֲרֵגָֽה׃ס\rb*
\q1 \v 4 \rb How long|עַד־\rb*\rb |מָתַי֙\rb* \rb will the land|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb* \rb mourn|תֶּאֱבַ֣ל\rb*
\q2 \rb and the grass|וְעֵ֥שֶׂב\rb* \rb of every|כָּל־\rb* \rb field|הַשָּׂדֶ֖ה\rb* \rb be withered?|יִיבָ֑שׁ\rb*
\q1 \rb Because of the evil|מֵרָעַ֣ת\rb* \rb of its residents,|יֹֽשְׁבֵי־\rb*
\q2 \rb the animals|בְהֵמוֹת֙\rb* \rb and birds|וָע֔וֹף\rb* \rb have been swept away,|סָפְתָ֤ה\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb the people have said,|אָמְר֔וּ\rb*
