\p \v 27 \rb “Then you are to tell them|וְאָמַרְתָּ֣\rb* \rb that|אֲלֵיהֶ֡םס\rb* \rb this is what|כֹּֽה־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֨ה\rb* \rb of Hosts,|צְבָא֜וֹת\rb* \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb* \rb says:|אָמַר֩\rb* \rb ‘Drink,|שְׁת֤וּ\rb* \rb get drunk,|וְשִׁכְרוּ֙\rb* \rb and vomit.|וּקְי֔וּ\rb* \rb Fall down|וְנִפְל֖וּ\rb* \rb and never|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb get up again,|תָק֑וּמוּ\rb* \rb because of|מִפְּנֵ֣י\rb* \rb the sword|הַחֶ֔רֶב\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֛ר\rb* \rb I|אָנֹכִ֥י\rb* \rb will send|שֹׁלֵ֖חַ\rb* \rb among you.’|בֵּינֵיכֶֽם׃\rb*
\p \v 28 \rb |וְהָיָ֗ה\rb* \rb If|כִּ֧י\rb* \rb they refuse|יְמָאֲנ֛וּ\rb* \rb to take|לָקַֽחַת־\rb* \rb the cup|הַכּ֥וֹס\rb* \rb from your hand|מִיָּדְךָ֖\rb* \rb and drink it,|לִשְׁתּ֑וֹת\rb* \rb you are to tell them|וְאָמַרְתָּ֣\rb* \rb that|אֲלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb this is what|כֹּ֥ה\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb of Hosts|צְבָא֖וֹת\rb* \rb says:|אָמַ֛ר\rb* \rb ‘You most certainly must drink it!|שָׁת֥וֹ\rb*\rb |תִשְׁתּֽוּ׃\rb* \v 29 \rb For|כִּי֩\rb* \rb behold,|הִנֵּ֨ה\rb* \rb I|אָֽנֹכִי֙\rb* \rb am beginning|מֵחֵ֣ל\rb* \rb to bring disaster|לְהָרַ֔ע\rb* \rb on the city|בָעִ֜יר\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֧ר\rb* \rb bears|נִֽקְרָא־\rb* \rb My Name,|שְׁמִ֣י\rb* \rb so how could you|וְאַתֶּ֖ם\rb* \rb possibly go unpunished?|הִנָּקֵ֣ה\rb*\rb |תִנָּק֑וּ\rb* \rb You will not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb go unpunished,|תִנָּק֔וּ\rb* \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֤י\rb* \rb am calling down|קֹרֵא֙\rb* \rb a sword|חֶ֗רֶב\rb* \rb upon|עַל־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the inhabitants|יֹשְׁבֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the earth,|הָאָ֔רֶץ\rb* \rb declares|נְאֻ֖ם\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb of Hosts.’|צְבָאֽוֹת׃\rb*
\p \v 30 \rb So you|וְאַתָּה֙\rb* \rb are to prophesy|תִּנָּבֵ֣א\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb these|הָאֵ֑לֶּה\rb* \rb words|הַדְּבָרִ֖ים\rb* \rb against|אֲלֵיהֶ֔ם\rb* \rb them|אֵ֥ת\rb* \rb and say|וְאָמַרְתָּ֣\rb* \rb to them:|אֲלֵיהֶ֗ם\rb*
\b 
