\p \v 26 \rb Then the word|דְּבַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb came|וַיְהִי֙\rb* \rb to|אֶֽל־\rb* \rb Jeremiah:|יִרְמְיָ֖הוּ\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 27 \rb “Behold,|הִנֵּה֙\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb am the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֖י\rb* \rb of all|כָּל־\rb* \rb flesh.|בָּשָׂ֑ר\rb* \rb Is anything|כָּל־\rb*\rb |דָּבָֽר׃\rb* \rb too difficult|יִפָּלֵ֖א\rb* \rb for Me?|הֲ‍ֽמִמֶּ֔נִּי\rb*
