\s1 Johanan Rescues the Captives
\p \v 11 \rb When Johanan|יוֹחָנָ֣ן\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Kareah|קָרֵ֔חַ\rb* \rb and all|וְכָל־\rb* \rb the commanders|שָׂרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the armies|הַחֲיָלִ֖ים\rb* \rb with|אִתּ֑וֹ\rb* \rb him|אֵ֤ת\rb* \rb heard|וַיִּשְׁמַע֙\rb* \rb of all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the crimes|הָֽרָעָה֙\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb Ishmael|יִשְׁמָעֵ֖אל\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Nethaniah|נְתַנְיָֽה׃\rb* \rb had committed,|עָשָׂ֔ה\rb* \v 12 \rb they took|וַיִּקְחוּ֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb their men|הָ֣אֲנָשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb and went|וַיֵּ֣לְכ֔וּ\rb* \rb to fight|לְהִלָּחֵ֖ם\rb*\rb |עִם־\rb* \rb Ishmael|יִשְׁמָעֵ֣אל\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Nethaniah.|נְתַנְיָ֑ה\rb* \rb And they found|וַיִּמְצְא֣וּ\rb* \rb him|אֹת֔וֹ\rb* \rb near|אֶל־\rb* \rb the great|רַבִּ֖ים\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb pool|מַ֥יִם\rb* \rb in Gibeon.|בְּגִבְעֽוֹן׃\rb*
