\q2 \rb take your positions|וְהִֽתְיַצְּב֖וּ\rb* \rb with helmets on!|בְּכ֥וֹבָעִ֑ים\rb*
\q1 \rb Polish|מִרְקוּ֙\rb* \rb your spears;|הָֽרְמָחִ֔ים\rb*
\q2 \rb put on|לִבְשׁ֖וּ\rb* \rb armor!|הַסִּרְיֹנֹֽת׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 5 \rb Why|מַדּ֣וּעַ\rb* \rb am I seeing this?|רָאִ֗יתִי\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb They|הֵ֣מָּה\rb* \rb are terrified,|חַתִּים֮\rb*
\q2 \rb they are retreating;|נְסֹגִ֣ים\rb*\rb |אָחוֹר֒\rb*
\q1 \rb their warriors|וְגִבּוֹרֵיהֶ֣ם\rb* \rb are defeated,|יֻכַּ֔תּוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb they flee|וּמָנ֥וֹס\rb* \rb in haste|נָ֖סוּ\rb* \rb without|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb looking back;|הִפְנ֑וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb terror|מָג֥וֹר\rb* \rb is on every side!”|מִסָּבִ֖יב\rb*
\qr \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb “The swift|הַקַּ֔ל\rb* \rb cannot|אַל־\rb* \rb flee,|יָנ֣וּס\rb*
