\q1 \rb In the north|צָפ֙וֹנָה֙\rb* \rb by|עַל־\rb*\rb |יַ֣ד\rb* \rb the River|נְהַר־\rb* \rb Euphrates|פְּרָ֔ת\rb*
\q2 \rb they stumble|כָּשְׁל֖וּ\rb* \rb and fall.|וְנָפָֽלוּ׃\rb*
