\q2 \rb like rivers|כַּנְּהָר֕וֹת\rb* \rb whose waters|מֵימָֽיו׃\rb* \rb churn?|יִֽתְגָּעֲשׁ֖וּ\rb*
\q1 \v 8 \rb Egypt|מִצְרַ֙יִם֙\rb* \rb rises|יַֽעֲלֶ֔ה\rb* \rb like the Nile,|כַּיְאֹ֣ר\rb*
\q2 \rb and its waters|מָ֑יִם\rb* \rb churn|יִתְגֹּ֣עֲשׁוּ\rb* \rb like rivers,|וְכַנְּהָר֖וֹת\rb*
\q1 \rb boasting,|וַיֹּ֗אמֶר\rb* \rb ‘I will rise|אַֽעֲלֶה֙\rb* \rb and cover|אֲכַסֶּה־\rb* \rb the earth;|אֶ֔רֶץ\rb*
