\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Advance,|עֲל֤וּ\rb* \rb O horses!|הַסּוּסִים֙\rb* \rb Race furiously,|וְהִתְהֹלְל֣וּ\rb* \rb O chariots!|הָרֶ֔כֶב\rb*
