\q1 \rb They say,|וַיֹּֽאמְרוּ֙\rb* \rb ‘Get up!|ק֣וּמָה׀\rb* \rb Let us return|וְנָשֻׁ֣בָה\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb our people|עַמֵּ֗נוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and to|וְאֶל־\rb* \rb the land|אֶ֙רֶץ֙\rb* \rb of our birth,|מֽוֹלַדְתֵּ֔נוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb away from|מִפְּנֵ֖י\rb* \rb the sword|חֶ֥רֶב\rb* \rb of the oppressor.’|הַיּוֹנָֽה׃\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 17 \rb There|שָׁ֑ם\rb* \rb they will cry out:|קָרְא֖וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb ‘Pharaoh|פַּרְעֹ֤ה\rb* \rb king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb* \rb of Egypt|מִצְרַ֙יִם֙\rb* \rb was all noise;|שָׁא֔וֹן\rb*
\q2 \rb he has let the appointed time|הַמּוֹעֵֽד׃\rb* \rb pass him by.’|הֶעֱבִ֖יר\rb*
\b 
