\b 
\q1 \v 20 \rb Egypt|מִצְרָ֑יִם\rb*\rb |יְפֵֽה־\rb* \rb is a beautiful|פִיָּ֖ה\rb* \rb heifer,|עֶגְלָ֥ה\rb*
\q2 \rb but a gadfly|קֶ֥רֶץ\rb* \rb from the north|מִצָּפ֖וֹן\rb* \rb is coming against her.|בָּ֥א\rb*\rb |בָֽא׃\rb*
\q1 \v 21 \rb Even|גַּם־\rb* \rb the mercenaries|שְׂכִרֶ֤יהָ\rb* \rb among her|בְקִרְבָּהּ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb are like fattened|מַרְבֵּ֔ק\rb* \rb calves.|כְּעֶגְלֵ֣י\rb*
