\q2 \rb together|יַחְדָּ֖יו\rb* \rb they will flee,|נָ֥סוּ\rb* \rb they will not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb stand their ground,|עָמָ֑דוּ\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb the day|י֥וֹם\rb* \rb of calamity|אֵידָ֛ם\rb* \rb is coming|בָּ֥א\rb* \rb upon them—|עֲלֵיהֶ֖ם\rb*
\q2 \rb the time|עֵ֥ת\rb* \rb of their punishment.|פְּקֻדָּתָֽם׃\rb*
