\q1 \v 22 \rb Egypt will hiss|קוֹלָ֖הּ\rb* \rb like a fleeing|יֵלֵ֑ךְ\rb* \rb serpent,|כַּנָּחָ֣שׁ\rb*\f + \fr 46:22 \ft Hebrew \fqa nachash\ft ; translated in most cases as \fqa snake\f*
\q2 \rb for|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the enemy will advance|יֵלֵ֔כוּ\rb* \rb in force;|בְחַ֣יִל\rb*
\q1 \rb with axes|וּבְקַרְדֻּמּוֹת֙\rb* \rb they will come|בָּ֣אוּ\rb* \rb against her|לָ֔הּ\rb*
\q2 \rb like woodsmen cutting down trees.|כְּחֹטְבֵ֖י\rb*\rb |עֵצִֽים׃\rb*
\q1 \v 23 \rb They will chop down|כָּרְת֤וּ\rb* \rb her forest,|יַעְרָהּ֙\rb* \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD,|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb dense|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb though|כִּ֖י\rb* \rb it may be,|יֵֽחָקֵ֑ר\rb*
\q1 \rb for|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb they are more numerous|רַבּוּ֙\rb* \rb than locusts;|מֵֽאַרְבֶּ֔ה\rb*
\q2 \rb they cannot|וְאֵ֥ין\rb*\rb |לָהֶ֖ם\rb* \rb be counted.|מִסְפָּֽר׃\rb*
\q1 \v 24 \rb The Daughter|בַּת־\rb* \rb of Egypt|מִצְרָ֑יִם\rb* \rb will be put to shame;|הֹבִ֖ישָׁה\rb*
\q2 \rb she will be delivered|נִתְּנָ֖ה\rb* \rb into the hands|בְּיַ֥ד\rb* \rb of the people|עַם־\rb* \rb of the north.”|צָפֽוֹן׃\rb*
\p \v 25 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֨ה\rb* \rb of Hosts,|צְבָא֜וֹת\rb* \rb the God|אֱלֹהֵ֣י\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵ֗ל\rb* \rb says:|אָמַר֩\rb* \rb “Behold,|הִנְנִ֤י\rb* \rb I am about to punish|פוֹקֵד֙\rb*\rb |אֶל־\rb* \rb Amon|אָמ֣וֹן\rb* \rb god of Thebes,|מִנֹּ֔א\rb*\f + \fr 46:25 \ft Hebrew \fqa Amon of No\f*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb along with Pharaoh,|פַּרְעֹה֙\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb Egypt|מִצְרַ֔יִם\rb* \rb with|וְעַל־\rb* \rb her gods|אֱלֹהֶ֖יהָ\rb*\rb |וְעַל־\rb* \rb and kings,|מְלָכֶ֑יהָ\rb*\rb |וְעַ֨ל־\rb*\rb |וְעַ֥ל\rb* \rb and those who trust|הַבֹּטְחִ֖ים\rb* \rb in Pharaoh.|פַּרְעֹ֔ה\rb* \v 26 \rb I will deliver them|וּנְתַתִּ֗ים\rb* \rb into the hands|בְּיַד֙\rb* \rb of those who seek|מְבַקְשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb their lives—|נַפְשָׁ֔ם\rb*\rb |וּבְיַ֛ד\rb* \rb of Nebuchadnezzar|נְבֽוּכַדְרֶאצַּ֥ר\rb* \rb king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb* \rb of Babylon|בָּבֶ֖ל\rb*\rb |וּבְיַד־\rb* \rb and his officers.|עֲבָדָ֑יו\rb* \rb But after|וְאַחֲרֵי־\rb* \rb this,|כֵ֛ן\rb* \rb Egypt will be inhabited|תִּשְׁכֹּ֥ן\rb* \rb as in days|כִּֽימֵי־\rb* \rb of old,|קֶ֖דֶם\rb* \rb declares|נְאֻם־\rb* \rb the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃ס\rb*
\b 
\q1 \v 27 \rb But you,|וְ֠אַתָּה\rb* \rb O Jacob|יַֽעֲקֹב֙\rb* \rb My servant,|עַבְדִּ֤י\rb* \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb be afraid,|תִּירָ֞א\rb*
