\q2 \rb |וְאֶֽת־\rb* \rb your descendants|זַרְעֲךָ֖\rb* \rb from the land|מֵאֶ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of their captivity!|שִׁבְיָ֑ם\rb*
\q1 \rb Jacob|יַעֲק֛וֹב\rb* \rb will return|וְשָׁ֧ב\rb* \rb to quiet|וְשָׁקַ֥ט\rb* \rb and ease,|וְשַׁאֲנַ֖ן\rb*
