\s1 Judgment on Elam
\p \v 34 \rb This is the word|דְבַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb came|הָיָ֧ה\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb Jeremiah|יִרְמְיָ֥הוּ\rb* \rb the prophet|הַנָּבִ֖יא\rb* \rb concerning|אֶל־\rb* \rb Elam|עֵילָ֑ם\rb* \rb at the beginning|בְּרֵאשִׁ֗ית\rb* \rb of the reign|מַלְכ֛וּת\rb* \rb of Zedekiah|צִדְקִיָּ֥ה\rb* \rb king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb* \rb of Judah.|יְהוּדָ֖ה\rb*\rb |לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb* \v 35 \rb This is what|כֹּ֤ה\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb of Hosts|צְבָא֔וֹת\rb* \rb says:|אָמַר֙\rb*
