\c 50
\s1 A Prophecy against Babylon
\p \v 1 \rb This is the word|הַדָּבָ֗ר\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁ֨ר\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֛ה\rb* \rb spoke|דִּבֶּ֧ר\rb* \rb through|בְּיַ֖ד\rb* \rb Jeremiah|יִרְמְיָ֥הוּ\rb* \rb the prophet|הַנָּבִֽיא׃\rb* \rb concerning|אֶל־\rb* \rb Babylon|בָּבֶ֖ל\rb* \rb and|אֶל־\rb* \rb the land|אֶ֣רֶץ\rb* \rb of the Chaldeans:|כַּשְׂדִּ֑ים\rb*\f + \fr 50:1 \ft That is, the Babylonians; also in verses 8, 25, 35, and 45\f*
