\c 51
\s1 Judgment on Babylon
\p \v 1 \rb This is what|כֹּ֚ה\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb says:|אָמַ֣ר\rb*
\b 
\q1 \rb “Behold,|הִנְנִי֙\rb* \rb I will stir up|מֵעִ֣יר\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb Babylon|בָּבֶ֔ל\rb*
