\q2 \rb whose name|שְׁמֽוֹ׃ס\rb* \rb is the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb of Hosts.|צְבָא֖וֹת\rb*
\p \v 58 \rb This is what|כֹּֽה־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb of Hosts|צְבָא֗וֹת\rb* \rb says:|אָמַ֞ר\rb*
