\p \v 20 \rb As for the two|שְׁנַ֗יִם\rb* \rb pillars,|הָעַמּוּדִ֣ים׀\rb* \rb the|אֶחָד֙\rb* \rb Sea,|הַיָּ֤ם\rb* \rb the twelve|שְׁנֵים־\rb*\rb |עָשָׂ֤ר\rb* \rb bronze|נְחֹ֙שֶׁת֙\rb* \rb bulls|וְהַבָּקָ֞ר\rb* \rb under it,|תַּ֣חַת\rb* \rb and the movable stands|הַמְּכֹנ֔וֹת\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb that|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb King|הַמֶּ֥לֶךְ\rb* \rb Solomon|שְׁלֹמֹ֖ה\rb* \rb had made|עָשָׂ֛ה\rb* \rb for the house|לְבֵ֣ית\rb* \rb of the LORD,|יְהוָ֑ה\rb*\rb |לֹא־\rb* \rb the weight|מִשְׁקָ֔ל\rb* \rb of the bronze|לִנְחֻשְׁתָּ֖ם\rb* \rb from all|כָּל־\rb* \rb these|הָאֵֽלֶּה׃\rb* \rb articles|הַכֵּלִ֥ים\rb* \rb was beyond measure.|הָיָ֣ה\rb* \v 21 \rb Each|הָאֶחָ֔ד\rb* \rb pillar|וְהָעַמּוּדִ֗ים\rb* \rb was eighteen|שְׁמֹנֶ֨ה\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֵ֤ה\rb* \rb cubits|אַמָּה֙\rb* \rb tall|קוֹמָה\rb*\rb |הָעַמֻּ֣ד\rb* \rb and twelve|שְׁתֵּים־\rb*\rb |עֶשְׂרֵ֥ה\rb* \rb cubits|אַמָּ֖ה\rb* \rb in circumference;|יְסֻבֶּ֑נּוּ\rb*\f + \fr 52:21 \ft Each pillar was approximately 27 feet high and 18 feet in circumference (8.2 meters high and 5.5 meters in circumference).\f* \rb each was hollow,|נָבֽוּב׃\rb* \rb four|אַרְבַּ֥ע\rb* \rb fingers|אַצְבָּע֖וֹת\rb* \rb thick.|וְעָבְי֛וֹ\rb*\f + \fr 52:21 \fqa 4 fingers \ft is approximately 2.9 inches or 7.4 centimeters.\f* \v 22 \rb The bronze|נְחֹ֗שֶׁת\rb* \rb capital|וְכֹתֶ֨רֶת\rb* \rb atop|עָלָ֜יו\rb* \rb one pillar|הָאַחַת֮\rb* \rb was five|חָמֵ֣שׁ\rb* \rb cubits|אַמּוֹת֒\rb* \rb high,|וְקוֹמַ֨ת\rb*\f + \fr 52:22 \fqa 5 cubits \ft is approximately 7.5 feet or 2.3 meters.\f* \rb with a network|וּשְׂבָכָ֨ה\rb* \rb of bronze|נְחֹ֑שֶׁת\rb* \rb pomegranates|וְרִמּוֹנִ֧ים\rb*\rb |עַֽל־\rb*\rb |הַכּוֹתֶ֛רֶת\rb* \rb all around.|סָבִ֖יב\rb*\rb |הַכֹּ֣ל\rb* \rb The second|הַשֵּׁנִ֖י\rb* \rb pillar,|לַֽעַמּ֥וּד\rb* \rb with its pomegranates,|וְרִמּוֹנִֽים׃\rb* \rb was similar.|וְכָאֵ֛לֶּה\rb* \v 23 \rb Each capital had|וַיִּֽהְיוּ֙\rb* \rb ninety-six|תִּשְׁעִ֥ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשָּׁ֖ה\rb* \rb pomegranates|הָֽרִמֹּנִ֔ים\rb* \rb on the sides,|ר֑וּחָה\rb* \rb and